239
00:15:45,817 --> 00:15:47,857
Slow, slow beam!

240
00:15:47,857 --> 00:15:50,317
Beam, beam, beam!

241
00:15:50,317 --> 00:16:00,177
れて Get the book's golden heads!

242
00:16:00,597 --> 00:16:24,477
Time marches on, but neither combatant has emerged as a winner in the final round of

243
00:16:24,477 --> 00:16:30,157
this dainty-back fight. It's truly unusual for someone to last so long against Foxy in his own territory.

244
00:16:33,457 --> 00:16:37,377
Even if they can't see him, the crowd cheers for our boss with all their hearts.

245
00:16:37,557 --> 00:16:38,457
Luffy won't lose.

246
00:16:38,537 --> 00:16:41,557
Well, that goes without saying. He's Luffy and he has an afro.

247
00:16:41,817 --> 00:16:45,317
I'd say being Luffy should be more than enough, though the afro is nice.

248
00:16:45,557 --> 00:16:51,297
Okay, you're gonna have to explain this afro thing to me. You're all acting like it powers him up, but that doesn't make any sense.

249
00:16:51,297 --> 00:16:56,037
I think this is the longest combat round I've ever seen. The guy is made of rubber, after all.

250
00:16:56,097 --> 00:16:58,117
He's made of rubber and he has an afro.

251
00:16:58,837 --> 00:17:00,997
Really? Am I the only one who doesn't get this?

252
00:17:01,177 --> 00:17:05,997
